SUMMARY:OctoBullFest 2026
DESCRIPTION:Bull City Burger & Brewery’s annual OctoBullFest returns for two weeks of fall food\, freshly brewed beer\, and downtown Durham good times. Expect Stierstadt Octoberfest Lager\, brewed once a year for the event\, plus limited-time favorites including pasture-raised bratwurst\, giant rye soft pretzels\, mustard and mushroom gravy dirty fries\, grass-fed burgers\, and house-made veggie burgers. Families\, kids\, and dogs on the patio are welcome.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/octobullfest-2026/
LOCATION:Bull City Burger & Brewery\, 107 E Parrish St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/BCBB-Social_NEW-Instagram-45-78.jpg
