SUMMARY:Oktoberfest at Ponysaurus Brewing Co.!
DESCRIPTION:September 19 – October 4 \nHold onto your lederhosen! Ponysaurus Brewing Co. is celebrating Oktoberfest with small batch German-style beers\, Oktoberfest Flights\, and beer braised bratwurst 🍻🇩🇪 \nOn Tap:\n🍺 Gosé 🍺 Tell The Truth Kölsch 🍺 Helles Lager 🍺 Hefeweizen\n🍺 Small batch Rauchbier 🍺 Small batch Vienna Lager 🍺 Small batch Altbier\nOktoberfest Flights: Gosé\, Tell The Truth Kölsch\, Helles Lager\, and Hefeweizen ✈️🍺 \nOn the Menu:\nBeer-braised brats with peppers\, onions\, melted Swiss\, 1000 Island dressing\, chips\, and Dijon mustard 🌭 \nHead to ponysaurusbrewing.com/oktoberfest for a full festival rundown! Prost!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/oktoberfest-at-ponysaurus-brewing-co/
LOCATION:Ponysaurus Brewing Co.\, 219 Hood Street\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Brewery,Festival,Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Oktoberfest-Horizontal-01.jpg
GEO:35.9895631;-78.8952487
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Ponysaurus Brewing Co. 219 Hood Street Durham 27701;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=219 Hood Street:geo:-78.8952487,35.9895631
END:VEVENT
