SUMMARY:First Friday Latin Nights at The Velvet Hippo!
DESCRIPTION:Head out to your favorite tropical escape in Downtown Durham for Latin Night every First Friday — now starting at 8pm! Join us as DJ Synko heats up the dance floor with classic salsa\, merengue\, and bachata from 8-10pm\, mixing in the best of reggaeton\, perrea\, Latin house\, dembow\, cumbia\, and more from 10pm to 1:30am. Show off your moves\, or just vibe to the music and enjoy creative cocktails and great company on the roof. Drink specials\, no cover\, 21+ with valid ID to enter. Come early to beat the line – if you know\, you know!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/first-friday-latin-nights-at-the-velvet-hippo-3-2/
LOCATION:The Velvet Hippo\, 119 Orange Street\, 3rd Floor\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Adults Only,Dance,DJ,Latinx,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ongoing-Latin-Night-Update.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="The Velvet Hippo":MAILTO:hello@velvethippodurham.com
GEO:35.9964307;-78.9004895
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Velvet Hippo 119 Orange Street 3rd Floor Durham 27701;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=119 Orange Street\, 3rd Floor:geo:-78.9004895,35.9964307
END:VEVENT
