DESCRIPTION:Enjoy FREE coffee\, pastries\, conversation\, and creativity with Golden Belt Artists. \nLive painting demo by featured artist Paul J. Gala – one lucky attendee will WIN Paul’s demo painting in the free raffle drawing! \nLearn more about Paul and his friends Soonja Cook\, Maureen Dunlap\, Christine Hager-Braun\, and Matt Tomko. \nHope to see you there! Reserve your spot today by scanning the QR Code above or using one of the links below: \nGoogle Form \nEventbrite \nFacebook Event
