SUMMARY:Urban Ministries of Durham’s Fall Festival
DESCRIPTION:Fall Festival benefitting Urban Ministries of Durham\, one of the largest homeless shelters in Durham. Food Trucks\, Pumpkin & Face Painting\, Games & Prizes\, Music & Fun\, Trunk or Treat\, 50/50 Raffle and Kids Costume Contest. If anyone is interested in exhibiting at the Fall Festival\, please ask them to text or email Shana at sfilter@umdurham.org or 919-671-7988 (cell). Thank you very much!
