SUMMARY:JIM MCKEON: DURHAM SWEET DURHAM
DESCRIPTION:5 Points Gallery is proud to present Durham Sweet Durham\, a new exhibition of oil paintings by Featured Artist Jim McKeon celebrating the vibrant soul of the Bull City through crisp realism and touches of fantasy. From historic brick warehouses to the wild banks of the Eno River\, familiar Durham landscapes become evocative scenes of memory\, community\, and place. Throughout the gallery\, visitors can also enjoy work by our ten Triangle-based artists\, offering a refreshing mix of painting\, sculpture\, fused glass\, mixed media\, and finely crafted furniture\, with each artist bringing a distinct creative perspective. Join us for the Opening Reception on Friday\, September 18\, 2026\, from 6–9 pm to meet the artist. Durham Sweet Durham runs from September 17 through October 10\, 2026. Image: 4th of July\, Bulls Stadium\, oil on canvas\, 90 × 66 inches. \nVisit 5 Points Gallery in person or online at https://5pointsgallery.com. All work from the exhibition is available for shipping or pickup. Gallery hours: Thursdays and Fridays 5–9pm\, Saturdays 1–9pm. Artists are available to talk about their work. For a private viewing\, contact us at info@5pointsgallery.com.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/jim-mckeon-durham-sweet-durham/2026-10-03/
LOCATION:5 Points Gallery\, 109 E Chapel Hill St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
