SUMMARY:Fall Film Series
DESCRIPTION:Durham Parks and Recreation presents a FREE Fall Movies in the Park series at Durham Central Park! Bring your blankets\, lawn chairs and your favorite people for a fun movie night in the heart of downtown Durham. This family-friendly series features films for all ages. \nLocal food trucks will be on site serving up tasty bites\, so come early\, grab some dinner\, and settle in for a memorable night outdoors.There’s no better way to spend a cool fall evening than with great movies\, good food\, and community vibes—all for free!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/fall-film-series/2026-10-03/
