SUMMARY:Move-A-Bull City Open Streets
DESCRIPTION:Bike Durham\, the City of Durham\, and the Durham County Public Health Department’s Partnership for a Healthy Durham are teaming up to make our streets healthier\, safer\, and more joyful – for folks of all ages and abilities. From 12-4pm on Sunday\, October 4th\, Blackwell\, Corcoran\, and Foster streets will be closed for cars and open for people. A variety of activities spanning arts\, music\, local government\, food\, wellness\, and physical activity will take place along the corridor.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/move-a-bull-city-open-streets/
