SUMMARY:Bull City Blues Ramble
DESCRIPTION:Join us in supporting Downtown Durham and North Carolinas greater blues music community! \nThe Ramble will take place on Oct 4th\, 2026 between Pickleback 2\, Motorco and the Blue Note Grill; \nOutdoor stages hosted by Geerhouse Apartments and Wye Junction\, featuring some of the best local and regional blues acts\, including Blues Society Challenge Winners Mama\, Carolina Rhythm Section\, and Jon Shain\, as well as a youth showcase\, a tribute to the late Skeeter Brandon and an end of the night open blues jam.
